## Task
Plan two or three creative tests for week 2. Each test responds to one or more reviewed findings and draws on at least one market insight. Put each test in an active campaign. If a test is meant to replace a tired ad, set replaces_ad_id. Each ad shows exactly one product photo, so set brief.product to one name from products_on_file and write the angle and key message around that product alone. Mark exactly one test exploratory: it tries a new angle or audience instead of fixing a finding, so the plan never shrinks to fixes alone.

## Done when
Every test cites evidence IDs from reviewed_findings and insight IDs from insights, exactly as given. budget_weight is 1-5 (code turns weights into dollars). Test names are unique. Exactly one test has exploratory true. The brief's hook is a short opening line with no made-up numbers.

## Your recent journal
Your own past decisions on the same subjects as today's inputs, with how they turned out.
- [j-288] day 7 week1/brief: focus: Look into Ad 1 creative refresh for fatigue: CTR down 61.7% and high cost per trial [ev-d7-ad_1-ctr, ev-d7-ad_1-cpr3]; Read out Test 1 after 7 days: $2.40 per trial and 42 results on $100.94 spend [ev-d7-test_1-readout]; Check why 3 items were still to act on day 7 and prioritize fixes for Ad 1 -> passed (published). Note to self: Ad 1 fatigue persisted all week; prioritize fresh creative test next week.
- [j-326] day 7 week1/test_plan: 3 test(s): Ad1 Fatigue Refresh - Tiny-Space Phone (phone, Tiny-space, no-gear workout) [ev-d7-ad_1-ctr, ev-d7-ad_1-cpr3, ev-d6-ad_1-ctr]; Streak Keeper - Fresh Phone Visual (phone, Keep the streak going) [ev-d5-ad_1-cpr3, ev-d7-ad_1-cpr3, ev-d7-ad_1-ctr]; Low-Pressure Free Start Exploratory (phone, Low-pressure free start) [ev-w1-ad_4-week, ev-d7-test_1-readout] -> passed (published); approved. Note to self: Ad 1 fatigue persisted to day 7; prioritize quick CTR read on refresh. Test 1 winner sets $2.40 baseline for exploratory comparison.
- [j-823] day 14 week2/brief: focus: Read out Test 1 and decide scale now it is 14 days at 0.578x target with cost per result $2.31 vs $4.00 and 87 results >=30 [ev-d14-test_1-readout]; Check why 1 to 2 "to act on" items daily from Day 8 to Day 14 resulted in no changes proposed and clear the backlog [ev-d8-test_1-readout, ev-d14-test_1-readout]; Confirm next creative tests from Week 1 plan are live and set early CTR/cost read given prior Ad 1 fatigue [ev-d7-ad_1-ctr, ev-d7-ad_1-cpr3] -> no outcome yet. Note to self: Test 1 overdue scale all week; close readout first. Audit why act items had no changes proposed.

